    pese a hallarse lejos de cualquier subestaci\xF3n."
  loreEn: Ribbed high-voltage porcelain insulator split by a glassy fracture seam
    across its core. It retains traces of arc scorch despite sitting far from any
    utility line or substation.
  accentColor: {r: 0.92, g: 0.88, b: 0.78, a: 1}
